                    "text": "If pregnant: offered information and counseling on each option, with a referral if asked (59.5(a)(5))",
                    "type": "boolean"
                },
                {
                    "linkId": "b15.3",
                    "text": "If a minor: family participation encouraged, with no parent's consent required and no parent told (59.10(b))",
